# Copy to .githooks/secret-patterns (gitignored) and list patterns that must
# never appear in a commit: your real town name, real street names, depot
# coordinate prefixes, organisation name, etc. One extended-regex per line,
# matched case-insensitively against staged additions. Lines starting with #
# are ignored.
#
# Example entries (replace with your own):
voorbeeldstad
52\.123
